Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.40,0:00:07.63,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去寻找吧 收集起梦的碎片{\fad(250,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.61,0:00:18.68,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,即使胸中苦闷 去感受真切的现在吧{\fad(0,400)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.59,0:00:23.55,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比外表更单纯
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.46,0:00:27.19,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是却无法传达
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.09,0:00:34.66,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想要说的话 总是藏在口袋里
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.43,0:00:41.17,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,充满孩子气的话语 如今已无法开口
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.81,0:00:49.18,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽说时间会冲淡一切 我们却无法相互理解
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.45,0:00:55.41,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,24小时 一直相信着你
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.59,0:00:59.18,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看着你
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.36,0:01:03.92,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,即使只是俗常的话语
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.33,0:01:10.36,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,时间总是 微笑着匆匆流逝
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.54,0:01:21.97,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比起回忆 还是去追求理想的今天{\fad(0,1025)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.15,0:01:47.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我为什么会被击败
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.86,0:01:58.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我才不会输给你呢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.73,0:02:01.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.93,0:02:08.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道是我用错方法了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.04,0:02:16.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 我绝对没有有弄错
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.98,0:02:22.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要有这个四魂之玉
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.35,0:02:25.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不论几次都可以重新再来
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.55,0:02:26.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么人
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.76,0:02:29.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道这里是什么地方吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.86,0:02:31.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是人的话就离开
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.19,0:02:33.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是妖怪的话就要消灭你
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.49,0:02:34.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别乱来
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.60,0:02:38.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是巫女 椿
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.20,0:02:40.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是曾在此地修行的人
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.87,0:02:49.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,第63话 阻挡在前的红白巫女
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.67,0:02:54.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是令人怀念
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.90,0:02:57.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和当年几乎没什么改变呢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.24,0:03:00.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是红叶
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.88,0:03:02.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是牡丹
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.44,0:03:05.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在守着这里的只有你们吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.48,0:03:09.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们是师父最后的弟子
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.18,0:03:10.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原来如此
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.72,0:03:14.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,椿师姐也是我们师父的弟子
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.12,0:03:18.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不好意思 请问您今年贵庚了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.46,0:03:20.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,坦白说您看起来满年轻的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.26,0:03:24.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比你们两个年纪大是一定的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.47,0:03:26.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这也是修行的成果
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.93,0:03:29.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有能保持青春的法术吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.64,0:03:31.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要你们也不断继续修行
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.11,0:03:33.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是能办得到的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.08,0:03:37.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过可不是简单的事呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.78,0:03:39.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么椿师姐
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.08,0:03:43.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是什么事情让您回到这里呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.58,0:03:46.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我现在正被妖怪追着
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.42,0:03:47.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妖怪？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.79,0:03:50.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么 这两人该怎么处理
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.36,0:03:52.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要不要杀掉她们算了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.29,0:03:54.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请让我们帮助您 椿师姐
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.53,0:03:57.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为椿师姐是我们的师姐
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.67,0:04:09.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对了 从那之后
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.31,0:04:15.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我受到了黑巫女 椿的诅咒
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.30,0:04:29.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,已经没事了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.63,0:04:31.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没事了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.30,0:04:33.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.07,0:04:35.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇姑娘
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.37,0:04:36.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.37,0:04:37.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.74,0:04:40.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的没事了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.94,0:04:44.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,诅咒者的名字是椿吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.75,0:04:46.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这和五十年前与桔梗姐姐
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.88,0:04:50.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,并驾齐驱的巫女的名字一模一样
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.02,0:04:53.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么为何是黑巫女
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.52,0:04:55.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.26,0:04:58.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许只是凑巧名字相同
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.96,0:05:00.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.39,0:05:02.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我感受到四魂之玉了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.03,0:05:05.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是真的吗 戈薇姑娘
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.33,0:05:06.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的 很清楚的感受到
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.90,0:05:08.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也只有那块大号的碎片吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.84,0:05:10.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么 在哪个方向
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.91,0:05:15.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在那边
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.48,0:05:17.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只有去看看了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.11,0:05:21.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是取回四魂之玉的大好机会
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.92,0:05:23.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么啊 枫姥姥
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.78,0:05:24.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你也想跟去吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.12,0:05:26.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对方是黑巫女
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.55,0:05:29.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我这个巫女跟着去比较好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.06,0:05:30.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要说巫女的话
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.06,0:05:32.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都老太婆了还算是巫女吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.99,0:05:34.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.19,0:05:36.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉 坐下
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.50,0:05:39.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没礼貌的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.70,0:05:41.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了 走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.80,0:05:43.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走吧 云母
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.94,0:05:45.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来吧 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.81,0:05:47.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,臭家伙…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.01,0:05:49.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在那边
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.44,0:05:50.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.01,0:05:55.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 不要把我忘啦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.03,0:06:07.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,椿 你领悟的很快
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.23,0:06:09.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的吗 师父
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.23,0:06:10.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.04,0:06:18.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从那之后过了六十年
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.47,0:06:22.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,师父当然已经离开人世了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.68,0:06:24.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,椿师姐
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.61,0:06:27.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,使用这座馆代代相传的护符
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.05,0:06:30.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,应该就能消灭妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.62,0:06:32.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么 该怎么做呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.62,0:06:35.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请交给我们 椿师姐
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.62,0:06:37.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,即使无法消灭妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.26,0:06:38.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,至少能抵挡一阵子
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.99,0:06:40.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们办得到吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.26,0:06:42.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对方可是相当邪恶的妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.00,0:06:45.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们也累积了许多修行
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.20,0:06:48.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,消灭妖怪是我们巫女的天职
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.20,0:06:51.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么就交给你们了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.07,0:06:53.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尽量帮我争取时间
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.14,0:06:55.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.71,0:07:03.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些如何 红叶
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.45,0:07:06.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要有这些就没问题了 牡丹
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.29,0:07:08.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是这是第一次呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.02,0:07:11.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以才要放手一搏啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.79,0:07:14.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的 这也是一种修行与经验
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.60,0:07:18.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.67,0:07:20.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去消灭妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.25,0:07:42.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这扇门绝对不能打开
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.06,0:07:45.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为这是禁忌的多宝塔
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.50,0:07:52.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,禁忌吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.27,0:07:59.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.51,0:08:02.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落要你归还四魂之玉
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.84,0:08:04.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是我的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.95,0:08:07.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是说好奈落的愿望实现了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.71,0:08:10.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,才将它交给你吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.45,0:08:11.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会用这块四魂之玉
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.09,0:08:14.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来实现约定的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.46,0:08:15.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个叫戈薇的女人也好
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.86,0:08:18.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉也好 我会杀掉所有人
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.36,0:08:19.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么做
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.66,0:08:21.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不是已经输了一次吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.60,0:08:24.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个地方拥有力量
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.73,0:08:29.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要有四魂之玉 就能够利用的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.54,0:08:31.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总觉得你没啥自信呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.74,0:08:34.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,告诉你一件好事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.81,0:08:35.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么事
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.94,0:08:39.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,使用四魂之玉最好的方法
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.19,0:08:47.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在那边
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.32,0:08:48.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.82,0:08:51.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了 云母
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.46,0:08:52.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.47,0:09:01.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那什么东西啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.04,0:09:03.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是结界
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.47,0:09:09.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们巫女设下的 让妖怪无法进入的结界
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.61,0:09:11.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是椿搞的鬼吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.48,0:09:13.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,四魂之玉的气息在前面
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.72,0:09:17.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这种结界我马上就打破它
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.89,0:09:19.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好痛
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.62,0:09:23.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.73,0:09:31.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了好了 这可不是闹着玩的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.13,0:09:34.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是对妖怪才有反应的结界
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.50,0:09:38.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就交给我和枫姥姥吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.51,0:09:40.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现身了吗 妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.87,0:09:42.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等你好久了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.88,0:09:46.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就是要追杀椿师姐的妖怪 犬夜叉吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.11,0:09:50.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么啊 你们是椿的同伙吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.52,0:09:52.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,椿师姐是我们的师姐
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.75,0:09:54.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们当然站在她那边
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.76,0:09:56.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们也是黑巫女吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.52,0:09:58.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就饶不了你们
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.39,0:09:59.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,黑巫女？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.66,0:10:01.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,居然愚弄我们
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.53,0:10:03.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们不是黑巫女吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.13,0:10:04.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,少胡说八道 妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.30,0:10:06.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的名字是红叶
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.67,0:10:09.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的名字是牡丹
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.94,0:10:13.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们是学习消灭妖怪的巫女
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.41,0:10:16.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别和诅咒别人的黑巫女混为一谈
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.41,0:10:18.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总觉得她们蛮正派的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.05,0:10:22.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她们不是椿的手下吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.28,0:10:23.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了好了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.32,0:10:24.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们两个先稍等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.05,0:10:26.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,闭嘴！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.19,0:10:28.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看的出来 你是法师吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.69,0:10:30.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是驱魔师对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.16,0:10:32.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.66,0:10:35.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么奇怪的衣服
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.93,0:10:37.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是看起来似乎有灵力
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.57,0:10:40.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,巫女对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.30,0:10:42.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也可以这么说啦
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.07,0:10:46.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且为什么要和这种妖怪在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.81,0:10:48.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们把我当妖怪吗…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.71,0:10:51.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们可没做过害人的事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.95,0:10:53.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.21,0:10:56.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,讨厌啦红叶 他长得好可爱
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.72,0:10:59.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对啊 好可爱
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.46,0:11:03.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那只也好可爱
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.96,0:11:05.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.73,0:11:07.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.59,0:11:08.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.83,0:11:11.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她们看起来不像是坏人耶
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.97,0:11:14.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,至少先设法说服她们
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.60,0:11:15.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 两位姑娘
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.10,0:11:17.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.74,0:11:20.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,臭妖怪！居然伪装成这副模样
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.35,0:11:31.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,幻化成可爱的模样蒙骗那些人
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.52,0:11:32.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是对我们是没用的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.19,0:11:35.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们才不会被你的外表欺骗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.99,0:11:39.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是我吗？我很坏吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.86,0:11:41.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你慌张个什么劲啊 七宝
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.00,0:11:43.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再挡路的话
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.26,0:11:45.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,即使用武力我也要硬闯了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.27,0:11:46.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.87,0:11:48.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再让我试着说服看看
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.87,0:11:51.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上吧 牡丹
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.27,0:11:53.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看我的 红叶
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.51,0:11:55.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别这样嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.91,0:11:58.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒法师
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.78,0:11:59.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这家伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.65,0:12:01.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,几时过来的？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.28,0:12:04.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为何我们会和那些妖怪在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.52,0:12:05.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就让我说明吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.15,0:12:10.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说起来 一切的源头都是四魂之玉的存在
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.02,0:12:13.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妖怪们对于它的妖力…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.76,0:12:15.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,讨厌
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.30,0:12:17.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶 你这家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.90,0:12:19.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你向妖怪出卖自己的心
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.53,0:12:20.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,变成他们的同伙对不对
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.90,0:12:22.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,手 手…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.27,0:12:24.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被妖怪下了诅咒了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.94,0:12:27.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你那根本不是诅咒吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.67,0:12:29.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么办啦 真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.18,0:12:30.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你把事情弄得更麻烦了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.91,0:12:34.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真不好意思 我不小心就…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.41,0:12:35.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,椿在那边吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.05,0:12:37.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,休想过去
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.42,0:12:39.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.94,0:12:55.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.07,0:12:57.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是式神
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.34,0:13:01.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让魂魄寄宿在纸娃娃上 借以操纵它的法术
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.58,0:13:08.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些家伙很弱耶
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.45,0:13:10.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,根本不用认真对付嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.95,0:13:13.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的耶
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.13,0:13:20.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很有两下子嘛 妖怪们
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.86,0:13:24.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刚才只是牛刀小试
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.97,0:13:27.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也是为了拿到你们的头发
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.74,0:13:31.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她们两个该不会…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.47,0:13:33.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了 枫姥姥
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.47,0:13:36.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她们想用式神复制我们吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.48,0:13:38.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你居然会知道 老妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.25,0:13:39.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是巫女
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.76,0:13:52.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,复制的话 会复制谁
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.99,0:13:54.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.39,0:13:56.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管对手是谁 通通揍扁
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.50,0:14:01.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,居然…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.04,0:14:03.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这该不会是…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.77,0:14:05.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也觉得好像是…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.77,0:14:07.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是犬夜叉吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.77,0:14:09.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我才不是那副鸟样
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.64,0:14:12.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那 那个…该不会是
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.78,0:14:14.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可能是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.65,0:14:15.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想也是
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.65,0:14:16.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么说
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.02,0:14:19.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个该不会是戈薇吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.39,0:14:24.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.89,0:14:27.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我才不是那个样子啦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.28,0:14:43.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是隆重的仪式啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.41,0:14:45.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,封印有这么坚固吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.92,0:14:48.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是为了打开门的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.39,0:14:51.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,里面还布下了更强的封印
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.03,0:15:02.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,做得不错呢 牡丹
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.93,0:15:05.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,做得好可爱呢 红叶
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.04,0:15:07.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么样 吓到了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.94,0:15:10.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可不只是姿态而已
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.21,0:15:13.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能力也是原原本本的复制了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.31,0:15:14.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,根本不像
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.21,0:15:15.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一点都不像
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.31,0:15:17.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.38,0:15:22.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这种装腔作势的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.55,0:15:25.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,散魂铁爪
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.82,0:15:28.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,散魂铁爪
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.07,0:15:37.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要妨碍我 戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.83,0:15:40.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要对那家伙叫我的名字
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.57,0:15:45.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.58,0:15:47.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果那个式神也是犬夜叉的话
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.94,0:15:49.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,坐下！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.72,0:15:58.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇 你突然搞什么鬼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.59,0:16:00.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.49,0:16:04.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来身上物品的能力没办法复制
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.26,0:16:07.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过是个冒牌货
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.23,0:16:08.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然有点令人羡慕啦
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.10,0:16:14.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嘿嘿 你那什么刀啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.97,0:16:16.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我来啦
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.75,0:16:24.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇！想办法对付那个戈薇啦
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.12,0:16:25.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说过了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.98,0:16:28.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要用我的名字叫那个东西
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.62,0:16:31.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉才是 想点办法对付那个犬夜叉吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.39,0:16:32.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那才不是我呢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.39,0:16:35.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,唉呀呀 真是没办法
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.13,0:16:37.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,轮到我们上场了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.40,0:16:40.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,话是这么说…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.40,0:16:44.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的是很难对付耶
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.90,0:16:45.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒法师
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.77,0:16:47.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇那边麻烦你了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.54,0:16:49.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要再叫戈薇了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.41,0:16:52.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,唉呀 我比较想消灭犬夜叉耶
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.41,0:16:54.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就说那不是我啦
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.18,0:16:55.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也是 犬夜叉的话
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.05,0:16:57.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就能毫不留情扁他一顿
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.78,0:16:58.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.65,0:17:00.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们这些家伙什么意思啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.15,0:17:02.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 没什么
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.29,0:17:04.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,闪开你们两个
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.42,0:17:06.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这种角色
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.59,0:17:08.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,用风之伤马上就能解决
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.97,0:17:17.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看我的！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.74,0:17:23.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,身体…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.91,0:17:25.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么样 妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.48,0:17:27.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的行动已经被封住了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.58,0:17:31.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,七宝
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.35,0:17:35.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可爱的那只也很痛苦耶
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.79,0:17:38.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没办法呀…谁叫他是妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.36,0:17:40.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们两个还不住手
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.72,0:17:43.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个老妖怪居然还能够动
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.36,0:17:44.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.73,0:17:46.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.37,0:17:49.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们几个
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.27,0:17:50.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是再妨碍我们
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.40,0:17:52.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就把你们和妖怪一起消灭
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.44,0:17:54.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等 别这样
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.47,0:17:57.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们并没有做那种要被人家消灭的坏事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.24,0:17:58.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒法师
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.38,0:18:00.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先让这两个巫女安份下来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.01,0:18:02.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯 没办法了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.65,0:18:06.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要妨碍我们消灭妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.75,0:18:09.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们两个
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.72,0:18:12.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给我节制点
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.13,0:18:18.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再不节制点的话…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.93,0:18:24.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难缠的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.17,0:18:26.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不会认输的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.20,0:18:27.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们两个
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.67,0:18:28.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,注意了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.68,0:18:37.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,身体能动了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.32,0:18:42.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.96,0:18:54.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,接招吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.10,0:19:02.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.74,0:19:09.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.72,0:19:13.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是失去了意识
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.95,0:19:16.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有生命的危险
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.39,0:19:18.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里好像也没有受伤
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.35,0:19:20.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好痛…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.69,0:19:23.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这两人该怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.83,0:19:24.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她们醒过来之后
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.96,0:19:27.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,会不会又袭击我们啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.61,0:19:28.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可能是被椿欺骗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.98,0:19:30.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是被花言巧语拐骗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.34,0:19:32.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,反正只要好好的解释
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.78,0:19:34.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,应该就能让她们了解
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.51,0:19:37.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁要做这种苦差事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.38,0:19:39.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然是由我来做了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.49,0:19:41.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,由我来照顾她们两人
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.09,0:19:44.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好好的向她们说明吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.36,0:19:47.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,七宝 你和弥勒法师一起留在这里吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.59,0:19:50.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我？但是我要做什么才好
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.86,0:19:53.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要监视弥勒法师就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.42,0:19:57.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且如果是七宝的话
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.59,0:20:00.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或许更容易说服她们
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.53,0:20:01.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会好好加油的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.06,0:20:04.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,云母 你也留在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.03,0:20:08.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,随便你们 我要去追椿了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.17,0:20:09.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.84,0:20:17.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先等结界解除了再说
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.41,0:20:22.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,即将打开了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.65,0:20:24.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里到底有什么东西
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.99,0:20:27.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.19,0:20:34.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,百年前的当家 丧失了许多同门的性命
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.33,0:20:37.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也仅能将其封印的鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.80,0:20:40.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么厉害的鬼在这里面
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.50,0:20:41.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从此以后
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.60,0:20:43.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当家们一代又一代的封住了它
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.74,0:20:48.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总有一天你也必须 接下这个重责大任
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.34,0:20:50.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的 师父
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.31,0:20:55.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是绝对不能打开的 禁忌的多宝塔
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.33,0:21:09.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,封印在这座多宝塔的鬼非常强
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.16,0:21:11.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.60,0:21:15.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你打算用四魂之玉驾驭它吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.24,0:21:17.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错 我想试着用看看
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.71,0:21:21.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我绝对不会 就这样善罢甘休的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.68,0:21:27.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好像已经能看见了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.28,0:21:29.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,四魂之玉的气息在那边
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.48,0:21:31.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,椿就在那里面吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.89,0:21:40.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.76,0:21:41.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.06,0:21:44.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,连门也布下了结界
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.64,0:21:54.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是太乱来了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.91,0:21:58.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,滚出来 椿！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.33,0:22:21.06,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,究竟要流多少泪{\fad(500,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.20,0:22:27.97,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Every Heart  才能坦白面对自己
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.84,0:22:34.80,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,倘若对谁传达情感
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.58,0:22:41.54,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Every Heart  是否就能得到满足{\fad(50,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.09,0:22:48.15,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,害怕着漫长漫长的夜晚
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.59,0:22:55.06,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,朝着遥远的星星祈祷着{\fad(0,250)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.87,0:23:02.03,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在不停流转的时空之中
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.84,0:23:08.75,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们都在寻找真正的爱
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.38,0:23:15.81,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,希望自己能够变得更坚强
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.16,0:23:22.42,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天也要抬头看着高高的天空{\fad(0,100)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.96,0:23:29.03,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在不停流转的时空之中{\fad(150,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.67,0:23:35.84,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们都在寻找生命的意义{\fad(0,350)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.26,0:23:49.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.36,0:23:51.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么我会输给桔梗
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.76,0:23:53.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么塔
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.27,0:23:55.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,椿逃到里面去了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.27,0:23:57.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我到底缺少了什么
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.00,0:23:59.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是神乐
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.51,0:24:02.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么果然是椿跟奈落联手吧
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.31,0:24:03.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鬼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.31,0:24:06.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想要四魂之玉的话就服从我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.78,0:24:09.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,次回 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.38,0:24:11.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,多宝塔的巨大鬼怪
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.82,0:24:14.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要得到永远
